## Interface: 120100
## Title: Coby's Loot Sweeper
## Version: 0.0.3
## Author: Cobanyte
## OptionalDeps: Auctionator, TradeSkillMaster, Scrap
## Notes: Sell the loot from your old-raid and dungeon runs, and see what is worth auctioning. Everything you already had stays safe.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Bag_10
## AddonCompartmentFunc: CobysLootSweeper_OnAddonCompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: CobysLootSweeper_OnAddonCompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: CobysLootSweeper_OnAddonCompartmentLeave
